.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: zdots-draft <prompt>

Multi-source AI article drafting. Uses semantic search across the
knowledge_chunks database to retrieve relevant quotes and timelines from
multiple videos, then synthesizes a cohesive article using an LLM.

Requires local embedding and chat servers to be running (llama-ctl start).

Examples:
  zdots-draft "The evolution of the Agile manifesto based on historical interviews"
.fi
